          "text": "Description: Recent testimony (May 14, 2008) of an old observation: around 7:30 am one morning in 1960 (March, April, or May), two schoolchildren observe from the road a luminous phenomenon that intrigues them. After a few minutes, it disappears over the horizon. No additional information has been provided by the witnesses. The lack of precision and the ancient date of the observation make any investigation difficult, if not impossible.",
